FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM node:26.11.1-alpine3.23@sha256:f1394b3ffc021bc3f4aaf363e70a8d9667f7a9a63538bc824d7cc583129fffad AS build
WORKDIR /src
RUN npm install --global pnpm@11.9.0 && pnpm --version
COPY package.json pnpm-lock.yaml pnpm-workspace.yaml .pnpmfile.cjs ./
COPY LICENSE NOTICE ./
COPY docs/supply-chain/software-inventories/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt ./docs/supply-chain/software-inventories/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt
COPY patches ./patches
COPY apps/web ./apps/web
RUN pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
RUN pnpm --dir apps/web build

FROM caddy:2.11.7-alpine@sha256:d8542f48d34a9cf4e4c11a478865229840e87e4c96ea3f439101f31a5d35f75f
COPY deploy/Caddyfile /etc/caddy/Caddyfile
COPY --from=build /src/apps/web/dist /srv
COPY --from=build /src/LICENSE /src/NOTICE /usr/share/licenses/pathlab-viewer/

COPY --from=build /src/apps/web/dist/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt /usr/share/licenses/pathlab-viewer/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt
